        "id": "db65-4e85-2ec1-646b",
        "description": "If the Temple of Dramos successfully targets an enemy target squadron with its Target Lock, all Seraph Drones within Drone Nexus Range gain a Placed Bonus when firing at the same target squadron with Main Ordnance Weapons for that turn only!",
